              "pages": {
                "end": 20,
                "start": 20
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Joseffer, the petitioner contends that there is no uniform, deeply\u2011rooted common\u2011law tradition for state courts to decide whether the FDA would have approved a drug, making such tort claims novel and inappropriate."
        }
      ],
